  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</p>\r\n<p>We are excited to announce that we are looking for influencers to collaborate with our eco-friendly bikini brand! Our brand is committed to providing sustainable and eco-friendly swimwear options for women who love the beach and care about the environment. We are looking for influencers who share our values and are passionate about sustainability.</p>\r\n<p>As an influencer for our brand, you will have access to our amazing collection of sustainable swimwear. We will provide you with all the necessary tools to create engaging and inspiring content that resonates with your audience. In return, we ask that you share your authentic experiences with our brand and help us spread the word about our mission to create a more sustainable future.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>The minimal yet elegant style is a timeless classic that combines simple utility with endless style choices. Pieces will include seperate top and bottoms interchangeable, in a variety of sizes and colors. Also one piece swimsuits!</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Eco-Friendly, Price Friendly, Luxury Bikinis<br>&bull; Payment terms: Every week paid out!<br>&bull; Other information: Our 7 percent of sale will increase to 10 percent after a pre determined amount of pieces are sold!</p>\r\n</div>",
